{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "g-outside",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Logging の外側（利用側）",
      "x": -1420,
      "y": -760,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 1500,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "g-public",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "ragscope-logging / 公開 Facade",
      "x": -380,
      "y": -760,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 1500,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "g-internal",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "ragscope-logging / 内部モジュール",
      "x": 650,
      "y": -760,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 1500,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "g-external",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "外部ライブラリ・I/O",
      "x": 1810,
      "y": -760,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 1500,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# RAGScope Logging dependency map\n\n**対象実装:** `task/Step16`  \n**用途:** Workbench上の実装理解用メモ（非正本）\n\n- 実線: Haskell module の import / 利用依存\n- 公開 Facade と内部 module を Cabal 境界で分離\n- 正確な型・export・依存は RAGScope のコードと `ragscope.cabal` が正本\n",
      "x": -1420,
      "y": -1060,
      "width": 3960,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "main",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## executable `ragscope` / `Main`\n\n**役割**\n- composition root\n- `ExecutionId` を1回生成\n- production `Logger` を初期化\n- main library へ渡す\n\n**利用境界**\n`RAGScope.Logging.Setup`\n",
      "x": -1320,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "process",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## main library / 機能処理\n\n**知ってよいもの**\n- `Logger`\n- 機能固有の閉じたイベント\n- `emit`\n\n**知らないもの**\n- UUID / 時刻\n- JSON\n- stderr\n- `Core` / `Runtime`\n",
      "x": -1320,
      "y": -190,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "featurelogging",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## main library / 機能ログ定義\n\n機能固有イベントを\n`ToEventSpec` で共通 `EventSpec` へ写像。\n\n低水準の EventSpec API を利用する境界。\n",
      "x": -1320,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "tests",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## test-suite `ragscope-test`\n\n- 通常APIの `emit`\n- テスト専用 Facade\n- 固定ID / 固定Clock\n- Memory / Failure Sink\n\n内部moduleを直接利用しない。\n",
      "x": -1320,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "logging",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# `RAGScope.Logging`\n\n**通常利用 Facade**\n\n公開:\n- `Logger`\n- `LoggingFailure`\n- `emit`\n\nほぼ `Runtime` の安全な再公開。\n",
      "x": -280,
      "y": -590,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "eventspec",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# `RAGScope.Logging.EventSpec`\n\n**イベント定義 Facade**\n\n公開:\n- `ToEventSpec`\n- `EventSpec`\n- `Payload`\n- `LogError`\n- `debug/info/warn/failedEventSpec`\n- 各種 smart constructor\n\n`Core` のイベント定義APIだけを選んで公開。\n",
      "x": -280,
      "y": -190,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "setup",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# `RAGScope.Logging.Setup`\n\n**production 初期化 Facade**\n\n公開:\n- `LoggingConfig`\n- `LogLevel`\n- `ExecutionId`\n- `newExecutionId`\n- `newExecutionLogger`\n- `newServiceLogger`\n\n本番用の依存を具体的に選び、\n`mkLogger` へ注入する。\n",
      "x": -280,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "testing",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# `RAGScope.Logging.Testing`\n\n**test 専用 Facade**\n\n提供:\n- fixed EventId / ExecutionId / Clock\n- Memory Sink\n- Failure Sink\n- test event\n- test Logger constructor\n\nテストから内部表現へ直接依存させない。\n",
      "x": -280,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "core",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# `RAGScope.Logging.Core`\n\n**純粋な共通型・不変条件**\n\n- `SchemaVersion`\n- `ExecutionId`, `EventId`, `Timestamp`\n- `Component`, `EventContext`\n- `LogLevel`\n- `EventSpec`\n- `LogEvent`\n- `Payload`, `LogError`\n- `ToEventSpec`\n\nLogging基盤の最下層。\nI/Oを持たない。\n",
      "x": 760,
      "y": -560,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "runtime",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# `RAGScope.Logging.Runtime`\n\n**Logger の実行機構**\n\n保持する依存:\n- `EventIdSource :: IO EventId`\n- `Clock :: IO Timestamp`\n- `Sink :: LogEvent -> IO ...`\n\n主な処理 `emit`:\n1. `ToEventSpec`\n2. level filter\n3. EventId取得\n4. Timestamp取得\n5. `LogEvent` 完成\n6. Sinkへ渡す\n",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "backend",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# `RAGScope.Logging.Backend.AesonStderr`\n\n**production Sink**\n\n- `encodeLogEvent`\n  - `LogEvent -> Aeson.Value`\n  - JSON rootへ平坦化\n- `aesonStderrSink`\n  - 1 event = 1 line\n  - stderrへ出力\n  - `IOException` → `LoggingSinkFailure`\n",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 370,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## `uuid`\n\n`Data.UUID.V4.nextRandom`\n\nSetup が利用:\n- `ExecutionId`\n- 各 `EventId`\n",
      "x": 1900,
      "y": -570,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "time",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## `time`\n\n`Data.Time.getCurrentTime`\n\nSetup が利用:\n- 現在UTC時刻\n- `Timestamp`\n",
      "x": 1900,
      "y": -250,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "aeson",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## `aeson`\n\nBackend が利用:\n- `Value`\n- `object`\n- `(.=)`\n- `encode`\n\n`LogEvent` → JSON\n",
      "x": 1900,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "stderr",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## `System.IO.stderr`\n\nBackend が利用:\n- `hPutStrLn stderr`\n- `hFlush stderr`\n\nproduction の最終出力先。\n",
      "x": 1900,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ioexception",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## `IOException`\n\nBackend で `try` して捕捉。\n\n出力失敗を\n`LoggingSinkFailure`\nへ変換。\n",
      "x": 1900,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 正本への導線\n\n- [構造化ログ詳細設計](https://github.com/takashit16833/RAGScope/blob/main/project-docs/design/%E6%A7%8B%E9%80%A0%E5%8C%96%E3%83%AD%E3%82%B0%E8%A9%B3%E7%B4%B0%E8%A8%AD%E8%A8%88.md)\n- [`ragscope.cabal`](https://github.com/takashit16833/RAGScope/blob/task/Step16/ragscope-app/ragscope.cabal)\n- [`RAGScope.Logging.Setup`](https://github.com/takashit16833/RAGScope/blob/task/Step16/ragscope-app/logging-src/RAGScope/Logging/Setup.hs)\n- [`RAGScope.Logging.Runtime`](https://github.com/takashit16833/RAGScope/blob/task/Step16/ragscope-app/logging-src/RAGScope/Logging/Runtime.hs)\n- [`AesonStderr`](https://github.com/takashit16833/RAGScope/blob/task/Step16/ragscope-app/logging-src/RAGScope/Logging/Backend/AesonStderr.hs)\n",
      "x": -1420,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "2"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
